---
/**
 * The localized birth chart page body (es, pt, fr, it, ru). The English page,
 * src/pages/birth-chart/index.astro, is the reference layout: the form with a
 * computed sample beside it, the sample laid out like a result, the no-time
 * answer, privacy, what to do next, questions, and one closing invitation.
 *
 * Each locale page keeps its title, description, structured data and FAQ
 * (the reviewed answers, which its JSON-LD restates) and inlines the route
 * stylesheet, LocalizedBirthChart.css, in its head. Sample values come from
 * src/lib/sample-chart, computed at build time; the wording is COPY below,
 * with the shared catalog (t), sign, planet and aspect names reused where the
 * calculator already has them.
 */
